      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Small field but great race. Six-year-old mare BLONDE STAR (1) is the spring chicken of the field and has earned topweight. Forget the fresh run over unsuitable trip and go on top record at the mile and beyond and great stats when second-up. Fitter, has the claim and expected to go close. SUSHI EXPRESS (2) is fitter for two runs back and looks ready to fire. Crossed from wide out last time and gave a sight before being run down late. Extra trip a plus and will take beating. ZEWINNA (3) is a veteran mare who was fifth in the same race. op record this course and distance and can find winning form again. RUBBLEONTHEDOUBLE (5) is very well weighted under the minimum with the claim. Will give backers a sight. FIGHTING FLOYD (4) is another with no weight and will wind up late.",
